/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T11:15:30.317Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report. The agent ID and timings really helped us track this down quickly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat you’re seeing isn’t related to Maturin or Killick, and it’s not an issue with your Agent Computer. You don’t need to recover, reset, or delete any bots. This is a known issue on the Grok Bot service side that we’re tracking, and it’s not caused by your setup.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe messages you sent to those bots are queued, not lost. Please don’t run Update, Recover, or Reset on the computer, and don’t delete the bots. It won’t speed up recovery. Maturin II is on a different runner and is still working, so you can use it in the meantime.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI can’t share an exact ETA yet, but I’ll post an update here as soon as I have one. If the bots don’t come back soon, send me the bot name and the time of your last message, and I’ll double-check.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/yb-kevin\"\u003e@yb-kevin\u003c/a\u003e, you’re seeing the same thing. Update or reset won’t help here, and you don’t need to do anything to the bot. This is on our side, and we’re tracking it.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T11:15:30.317Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":7,"readers_count":6,"score":21.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":172134,"topic_slug":"individual-grok-bots-froze-deaf-comms-down","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","boo